Gensokyo Defenders is an action-packed tower defense game set in the Touhou Project universe. Play as nearly 20 popular characters, each with unique skills and spell cards. Defend your base from hordes of magical enemies by strategically placing traps and using character abilities. Features include tower defense mixed with action gameplay, spell cards and traps, multiple playable characters, online co-op mode, and a story mode following Cirno and Aya. Perfect for fans of tower defense games with direct player control and the colorful Touhou cast.
